{"id": "65357", "title": "美男客栈", "author": "浅宅·安然", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65357.htm", "intro": "我吐沫横飞的辱骂着，抬脚就要踢向他的要害。看见满月一双明亮的眼睛，顿时有好多种感情都袭上心头\r\n管你是走路来的，骑驴来的，坐车来的，还是搭砖机来的。姑奶奶不怕你，姑奶奶是穿越来的！！\r\n\r\n内容标签：穿越时空 阴差阳错 欢喜冤家\r\n搜索关键字：主角：依月蓉，满月少爷，羽菱，獘空，翼星。 ┃ 配角：一堆人等 ┃ 其它：\r\n\r\n\r\n======================================================================\r\n文章类型：原创-言情-架空历史-爱情\r\n作品风格：正剧\r\n全文字数：174896字 \r\n======================================================================", "base": "files/article/html/65/65357", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9731931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9731934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9731939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9731941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "9731943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "9731947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "9731949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "9731951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "9731953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "9731959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "9731962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9731964.html", "available": false}]}